{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 130,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This video was sponsored by KiwiCo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2350,
    "dDurationMs": 2203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More about KiwiCo at the end of the show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6070,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know what you're thinking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7320,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Clickbait!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8153,
    "dDurationMs": 3597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No one has measured the speed\nof light, that's ridiculous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11750,
    "dDurationMs": 6250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The speed of light is exactly\n299,792,458 meters per second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18520,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are so sure of it that since 1983,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20760,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've actually used the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22570,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to define how long a meter is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24660,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just the distance\nlight travels in a vacuum"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27060,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in 1/299,792,458ths of a second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31600,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That definition ensures\nthat the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34760,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is exactly this number, no decimals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38760,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But hear me out, in this video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41070,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will prove to you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42150,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that light may never\nactually travel at this speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46090,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I can say that because no\none has actually measured it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50280,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can't measure the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51910,
    "dDurationMs": 2673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same way we measure\nthe speed of anything else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62590,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: I think we're recording everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63830,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are we doing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64663,
    "dDurationMs": 2415,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is a video about\nmeasuring the speed of stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67078,
    "dDurationMs": 598,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: OK"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67676,
    "dDurationMs": 3894,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tell me about how you measured\nthe speed of the baseball"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71570,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fired out of your cannon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73460,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Well, to get the speed of the baseball,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74670,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to know two things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75910,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need to know the\ndistance between two points"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78380,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you need to know\nthe time that it takes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80070,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the baseball to travel\nbetween those points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82380,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So basically we took\ndistance divided by time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84950,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's the speed of the baseball."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87060,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in our case, we were shooting\nwith a high-speed camera,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89140,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you basically just count the frames"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91360,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then your clock is internal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93230,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you're going relativity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94470,
    "dDurationMs": 1723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're gonna do something\nweird, aren't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96685,
    "dDurationMs": 1072,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You saw it coming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97757,
    "dDurationMs": 875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can't believe it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98632,
    "dDurationMs": 978,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: Oh man!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99610,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing I want to ask you\nabout is the speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103143,
    "dDurationMs": 977,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: OK"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104120,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you measure the\nspeed of light like this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107710,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine you have a laser\nthat can fire a beam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110710,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through a perfect vacuum\nfor one kilometer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113750,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Start a timer the instant\nyou fire the laser beam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117250,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then exactly when it\nhits the end, stop the clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120940,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except how do you know when\nlight reaches one kilometer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124330,
    "dDurationMs": 2613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you and the clock are\nat the starting point?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127830,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so you need two\nclocks, one at the laser"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131000,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and one at the end,\nwhich stops automatically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133650,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it detects the laser light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135810,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now, how do you make sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137360,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your two clocks are synchronized?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139550,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, you could connect them via a wire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141660,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and send a pulse from one to the other,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144410,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that pulse will travel\nat the speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147030,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it will arrive with a time delay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149760,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might think you can just\nsubtract that time delay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152670,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it is equal to the time it takes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154750,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for light to travel one kilometer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156720,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what we don't know\nand are trying to measure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160970,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, new plan, start\nwith the clocks together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164240,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sync them up first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165970,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then send one of the\nclocks down to the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169000,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what could possibly go wrong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172090,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I'll tell you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173170,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The clock at the finish line was moving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174940,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with respect to the one at the start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176530,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and special relativity tells\nus moving clocks ticks slow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179820,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relative to stationary observers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181870,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So by the time the clock\nreaches one kilometer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184830,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will no longer be in sync\nwith the clock at the start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188230,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can I tell you the only\nsolution to this problem?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191550,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ditch the second clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193230,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Put a mirror at the end\nto reflect the light back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196390,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and use a single clock at the start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198330,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to time the full two kilometer round trip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201170,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Wasn't this actually done before?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203760,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was on a mountain and\nthere's a wagon wheel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205680,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a lantern and there's\nsomething like a mirror"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208800,
    "dDurationMs": 890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the other side of the mountain?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209690,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've always wanted to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211200,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, that sounds a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214040,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like how the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215160,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was first experimentally measured"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216870,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by Hippolyte Fizeau in 1849."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219700,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He shone a beam of light between the teeth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222110,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a rapidly spinning gear to a mirror"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224670,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up on a hill eight kilometers away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226980,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then by increasing\nthe speed of the gear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229030,
    "dDurationMs": 1917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he reached a point where\nthe reflected light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230947,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "passed through the next gap on the gear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233350,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so it was observed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235060,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he measured the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236300,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be 313,000 kilometers per second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239950,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is within 5% of the\npresently accepted value."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243930,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So someone has measured the\nspeed of light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247505,
    "dDurationMs": 1385,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or have they?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248890,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What has been measured is the round trip"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251260,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or two-way speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252970,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but no one has measured\nthe one-way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256840,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing I'm gonna throw at you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258680,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm just gonna come out and tell you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261370,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like what if the speed\nof light in this direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266150,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is different from the speed\nof light in this direction?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269530,
    "dDurationMs": 2238,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Then that sounds like\na Veritasium video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271768,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(both laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274020,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The question is could you figure it out?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275930,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The kind of crux of this problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277500,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the only way people have managed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279280,
    "dDurationMs": 3610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to measure the speed of\nlight is for a round trip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282890,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one's ever managed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284090,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to measure the speed of\nlight in just one direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286630,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's possible that the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288670,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is half of 'c' in one direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291680,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then instantaneous\non the return journey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293660,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: What?!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294460,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295650,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: Are you serious?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297570,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Think about communicating\nwith an astronaut"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299560,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stranded on Mars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301040,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's call him..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302441,
    "dDurationMs": 1030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303471,
    "dDurationMs": 4326,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We send out a signal and get\na response 20 minutes later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307797,
    "dDurationMs": 3782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we imagine our signal\ntakes 10 minutes to get there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311579,
    "dDurationMs": 3081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the reply takes 10\nminutes to come back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314660,
    "dDurationMs": 4746,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's possible that our\nmessage took all 20 minutes to get there "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319406,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the reply\ncame back instantaneously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323440,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no way we could\ntell the difference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325600,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between these two scenarios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327930,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But why would the speed\nof light be different?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331070,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it's possible that there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332590,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is some preferred direction\nthrough spacetime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335950,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, our universe\nhas a lot of symmetries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338400,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there is also some asymmetry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340600,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, why is there so much matter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343400,
    "dDurationMs": 2048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relative to anti-matter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345448,
    "dDurationMs": 1652,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And physicists have worked out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347100,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "internally consistent theories of physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349130,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in which the speed of light is different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351060,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forwards and in reverse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353320,
    "dDurationMs": 2692,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The speed of light could\nvary by just a few percent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356012,
    "dDurationMs": 3858,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up to at the extreme, going\n'c' over two in one direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359870,
    "dDurationMs": 2443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and infinitely fast in\nthe other direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363520,
    "dDurationMs": 2021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: Okay, so let me figure this out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366057,
    "dDurationMs": 907,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So yeah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367899,
    "dDurationMs": 1561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I kind of don't believe you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369658,
    "dDurationMs": 1273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I kinda don't believe you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371047,
    "dDurationMs": 2623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't believe you that\nlight is a different speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373670,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in one direction, but in the other,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375040,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I know you well enough to\nknow that you wouldn't call me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379180,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and put a camera on me unless\nyou knew you were right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382770,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's what scares me about this conversation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385198,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That scares me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388550,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, you might think it is just simpler"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391240,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that light should travel at the same speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393160,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in all directions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394460,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the truth is: that is a convention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397500,
    "dDurationMs": 2803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than an\nexperimentally verified fact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402550,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Einstein himself pointed this\nout in his famous 1905 paper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406660,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the Electrodynamics of Moving Bodies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408960,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He spends the first couple\nof pages on the problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411670,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of synchronizing clocks at\ndifferent locations A and B."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415530,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he says there is no way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417370,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can meaningfully\ncompare the times they measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420470,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unless we established by definition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423090,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the time required by\nlight to travel from A to B"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426120,
    "dDurationMs": 3293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equals the time it requires\nto travel from B to A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430450,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's essentially defining\nthat the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432730,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in opposite directions is the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435450,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he puts by definition\nin italics to remind us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438950,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this is only a convention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440780,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's known as the Einstein\nsynchronization convention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444160,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445330,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the speed of light is the\nsame in opposite directions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448130,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as Einstein would later write"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449720,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is neither a supposition nor a hypothesis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452550,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the physical nature of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454720,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but a stipulation that I can make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457380,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of my own free will to arrive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459650,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a definition of simultaneity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462340,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds a lot more subjective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464410,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than how I think most people would imagine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466580,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the speed of light is defined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468600,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: Dude, this is hardcore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471333,
    "dDurationMs": 1827,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473160,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've never thought about this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474360,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I didn't think about this before either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476120,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always assumed that when we said"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477880,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the speed of light is c,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478760,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we meant the one way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480680,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no way to define\nthe one-way speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482970,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the only thing we can really define"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484400,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the two way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485600,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just look at the way Einstein defined c."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488580,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's for the round trip\nfrom A to B and back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492200,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know if you saw\non your physics classes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493810,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but whenever there was a light clock"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495820,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would always bounce the\nlight up and then back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498790,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You would never see a light\nclock just bounce light one way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502150,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is why the only\nthing we can be certain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505120,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is constant for all inertial observers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507740,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the two-way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510010,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For over 100 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511720,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scientists have tried to\nfind a way around this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514500,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to measure the one way\nspeed of light by itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517720,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is a paper published"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518960,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the American Journal of Physics in 2009"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521180,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that claims to measure the\none-way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524220,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is the paper\ndebunking this study,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526970,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pointing out that these authors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528220,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were actually measuring\nthe two way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531400,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I'm imagining you\nmight have some ideas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533990,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for how to measure the\none way speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535700,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so let's go through some of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537710,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, can't we just\nuse a high-speed camera"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540090,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that shoots at a trillion frames a second"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542040,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we can actually see light\npassing through an object?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545830,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem is you're not only seeing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547750,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the light pass through the object,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549020,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're also seeing it\nbounce back to the camera,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551230,
    "dDurationMs": 2653,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "measuring the two way speed, not one way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554900,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Destin: Here you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556240,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Get a spool of fiber optic cable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559130,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know, like 186,000 miles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562400,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you could shine the light here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563860,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you have the other\nend of the fiber here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565730,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you could shine here and\nthen wait and see the delay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568860,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see if it's one second later over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570690,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The thing is like that fiber"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572020,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is going around and around and around,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573410,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it could be that when\nthe light goes this way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576110,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the top of the loop, it goes slower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579010,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then when it goes on\nthe bottom, it goes faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581670,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It all averages out in the fiber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583570,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you're essentially\ngetting lots of round trips"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585610,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in that fiber, so you're\nnever getting a one-way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588160,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if you center a synchronizing device"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590580,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between your two clocks and\nsend out simultaneous pulses?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594920,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, if the speed of light is\nthe same in both directions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597840,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this perfectly synchronizes your clocks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600450,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the speed of light is\ndifferent in each direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603440,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of the clocks will\nbe ahead of the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605840,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it will be ahead by\njust the right amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608450,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that when you measure\nthe speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610510,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll find the value to be C"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612870,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though that was not the\nspeed the light was traveling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616700,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the same reason GPS\nsynchronized clocks won't work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620650,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The whole GPS system is\nbased on the assumption"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623220,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the speed of light is\nthe same in all directions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626190,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the speed of light is\ndifferent in different directions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628900,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the light pulses from satellites"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630820,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will travel at different speeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632830,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the clocks won't be properly synced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635020,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By that, I mean they will always measure c"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637300,
    "dDurationMs": 3323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the one way speed of\nlight whether it is or isn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642770,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How about starting with\nsynchronized clocks in the middle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645790,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and moving them apart with\nequal and opposite speeds?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649450,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That way, the time dilation\nfor each clock will be the same"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652140,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they'll still be synchronized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653780,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they reached the end points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656030,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But again, this only works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658370,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the speed of light in\neach direction is the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661010,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the speed of light\ndepends on direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663340,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then so does time dilation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665670,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might think you could move the clocks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667670,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really, really slowly so that\ntime dilation is negligible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671740,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the speed of light is different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673690,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in different directions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675030,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't just use the standard formula"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677410,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to calculate what that\ntime dilation would be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679850,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it could be a\nlot worse than you think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682590,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the reality is we're stuck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685100,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need synchronized clocks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686540,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to measure the one-way speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688210,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but we need to know the\none-way speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690200,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to synchronize our clocks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692680,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this might sound like\njust an academic concern,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695520,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I want to go through an example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697030,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to illustrate just how\ndifferently the universe works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699640,
    "dDurationMs": 3103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the speed of light is not\nthe same in all directions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703680,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say on Mars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705330,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark is trying to synchronize\nhis clock with the Earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708980,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At noon, mission control\nsends out a message"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711220,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that says this signal was\nsent at exactly 12 o'clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714760,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When Mark receives this message,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716490,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he uses the Einstein\nsynchronization convention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719240,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to set his clock."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720840,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He knows the roundtrip\ntime delay is 20 minutes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723180,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he assumes the signal\nmust have taken 10 minutes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725650,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to reach him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727220,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He programs his clock to 12:10 PM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729550,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sends a return message."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731440,
    "dDurationMs": 1893,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This reply sent at 12:10."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735070,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The message is received\non Earth at 12:20 PM,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737460,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so both parties know the\nsynchronization was successful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740430,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the clock reads 12:20 on Earth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742510,
    "dDurationMs": 3403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it simultaneously reads 12:20 on Mars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747210,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now consider what\nhappens if the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749300,
    "dDurationMs": 2103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not the same in both directions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752560,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say it is 'c' over\ntwo from Earth to Mars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755700,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then instantaneous\nfrom Mars back to Earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758940,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one knows this, of course,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760290,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they continue to use\nthe Einstein convention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763080,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The message is sent from Earth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765140,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but now it takes a full\n20 minutes to reach Mars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768620,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Mark doesn't know this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770520,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as before he assumes the signal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772220,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "took 10 minutes to reach him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773340,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he sets his clock to 12:10 PM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775890,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though on Earth, it is now 12:20."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778800,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark then sends this\nreply sent at 12:10 PM,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782170,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is instantaneously received on Earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785080,
    "dDurationMs": 2183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at 12:20 Earth time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788560,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The experience for the two\ncommunicators is the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791910,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The same messages were received"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793690,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the same local time delays,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795830,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but their clocks are out\nof sync by 10 minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799220,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What they think is the same moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801030,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the other observer actually isn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804340,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there is no way\nthey can ever recognize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806520,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or correct this error."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808210,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine if someone on\nEarth immediately responded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810790,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how long did this message\ntake to reach you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812830,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's now 12:20."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814710,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the message would take\n20 minutes to reach Mars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817510,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but due to the clocks being out of sync,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819580,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would arrive at 12:30 Mars time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821940,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so Mark would reply 10 minutes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824180,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a message that would\ninstantaneously reach the Earth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827080,
    "dDurationMs": 2123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at 12:40 Earth time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830220,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The space-time diagram shows\nhow there is flexibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834210,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in what you consider to be the same moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836550,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at two different locations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838350,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in how you define the\none-way speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 841950,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Einstein chose the convention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843340,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the one-way speed of\nlight is always the same,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845840,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but from an experimental perspective,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848290,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any other convention is just as valid,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851200,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up to and including one\nwhere the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853650,
    "dDurationMs": 3893,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is C over two one way and\ninstantaneous the other way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858680,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in that case, it's\ninteresting to think about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861240,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what each observer is seeing\nwhen they look at the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864640,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mark would be seeing the Earth\nas it was 20 minutes ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868760,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Earth is seeing Mars in real time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872380,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exactly as it is right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 876160,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this effect wouldn't\nstop at Mars, look beyond it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879300,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you could see stars\nhundreds of light years away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882400,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not as they looked centuries ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884700,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but exactly as they\nare right this instant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889310,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the things is you\nonly know about that light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893130,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it reaches you and you\ndon't know anything about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895610,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what journey it took to get to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897140,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just see it and it's there,\nso like it's instantaneous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901110,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So an instantaneous\ninterpretation of that light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903240,
    "dDurationMs": 2843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just as good as one\nwhere it takes 'c' to reach us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907160,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is breaking my brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908990,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I mean, it's kind\nof unknowable, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911600,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It is unknowable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912640,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the whole point of the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914550,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is to say, we've all agreed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916430,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is based on something\nEinstein wrote in 1905."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918680,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've all agreed to just say\nit's 'c' in every direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922150,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the truth is the\nphysics works the same"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924710,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether it's 'c' or 'c' over\ntwo and instantaneous"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928270,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or anything in between."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929630,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As long as the roundtrip\nworks out to be 'c',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931870,
    "dDurationMs": 1827,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "none of physics breaks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933697,
    "dDurationMs": 1405,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's the crazy thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935310,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So if we can never measure\nthe one-way speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938060,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if it makes no difference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940150,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to any of the laws of physics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942630,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then what's the point in\neven talking about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945750,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that is certainly\none valid perspective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948240,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a debate that has\nbeen ongoing since 1905."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951950,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some physicists appeal to Occam's razor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954350,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't it just simpler if light\ntravels at the same speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 957210,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in all directions?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958370,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most working physicists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959850,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just accept the convention\nand move on with their lives,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963330,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think it's important to point out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964850,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it is just a convention,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966780,
    "dDurationMs": 2323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not an empirically verified fact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973670,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Personally, I find it fascinating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975750,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this is something about the universe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977990,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is hidden from us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979670,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, the round trip speed of light is 'c',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982380,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but does the one way speed\neven have a well-defined value?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986420,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if it doesn't,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987620,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what does that mean for the\nconcept of simultaneity?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990770,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When is right now on Mars?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993950,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it even make sense to talk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995440,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about things happening at the same time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997220,
    "dDurationMs": 1953,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if they're separated by distance?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999804,
    "dDurationMs": 3056,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Y'know maybe this is an odd quirk of the universe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002860,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's no good reason for it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005440,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or maybe, when physics takes\nthe next paradigmatic leap,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010060,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our inability to measure\nthe one way speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013260,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be the obvious clue to\nthe way General Relativity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017630,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Quantum Mechanics, space\nand time are all connected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022030,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we'll wonder why we\ndidn't see it before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030690,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, this video was sponsored by KiwiCo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033160,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They create awesome projects\nand toys to get kids making."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036860,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I use their crates with my son"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038430,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they are a lot of fun\nwhile also being educational."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041620,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, for viewers of this video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042800,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are offering 50% off\nyour first month of any crate,"
    } ]
  }, {
